{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20056","headline":"寄张籍 · 孟郊","name":"寄张籍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜镜不照物，朝光何时升。\n黯然秋思来，走入志士膺。\n志士惜时逝，一宵三四兴。\n清汉徒自朗，浊河终无澄。\n旧爱忽已远，新愁坐相凌。\n君其隐壮怀，我亦逃名称。\n古人贵从晦，君子忌党朋。\n倾败生所竞，保全归懵懵。\n浮云何当来，潜虯会飞腾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}